    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d22">

                <pb facs="0111" n="13" xml:id="pg13"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">500.C114/21: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in the Netherlands</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Phillips</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >The Hague</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-05-24T16:00:00+01:19"><hi rendition="#italic">May 24, 1920—4
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received May 25—6 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>87. Commission under League of Nations to discuss International Court of Justice
                    will open session in Peace Palace at The Hague June 12. England, France, Japan,
                    Spain, Brazil, Belgium, Holland and Servia will be officially represented. Mr.
                    Root will also attend.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Phillips</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
